    "stdout": "test_bootstrap_hash_is_checked_before_remote_function_can_execute (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nThe small metadata wrapper accepts only the exact supplied reviewed source hash. ... ok\ntest_changed_missing_or_linked_source_asset_cannot_prepare_a_view (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nA source mismatch, missing file or symlink stops the copy without changing original bytes. ... ok\ntest_changed_plan_or_source_or_observation_never_starts_network (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nA foreign repair plan or edited observed input fails before any SSH process is possible. ... ok\ntest_effective_command_changes_only_asset_record_and_new_packet_path (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nEvery original source/config/runtime input remains identical in the new prepare command. ... ok\ntest_exact_returned_metadata_binds_all_packet_and_repair_bytes (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nA complete zero-job repair stream is saved under only the exact expected local mirror paths. ... ok\ntest_existing_view_is_preserved_and_wrong_hash_cannot_be_relaxed (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nExisting destinations remain untouched and a revised expected hash is never inferred. ... ok\ntest_fresh_view_copies_only_expected_bytes_into_distinct_physical_files (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nExact new files share neither inodes nor links with any original, and logs remain outside the view. ... ok\ntest_real_local_frozen_inputs_and_observation_have_exact_known_names (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nThe real4533-file observation contains all4531 original hashes plus the two known logs. ... ok\ntest_returned_paths_identity_and_credit_are_strict (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nForeign paths, changed repair identity and Boolean credit substitutes cannot pass. ... ok\ntest_roster_rejects_extra_symlink_even_when_outside_manifest (independent_exact_asset_tests.AssetViewTests)\nThe old root observation cannot silently omit an unexpected linked file. ... ok\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nRan 10 tests in 2.538s\n\nOK\n",
